      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Footscray",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Maribyrnong River, once called the Saltwater River, ran through the area and was central to early settlement.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
